    <main id="main-content">

        <!-- Hero Landmark -->
        <section class="hero" id="overview">
            <div class="container hero-grid">
                <div>
                    <p class="eyebrow">Writing & Technology • Analytical Insights</p>
                    <h1>Human vs. AI: A Comparative Study of Writing Effectiveness</h1>
                    <p class="hero-copy">
                        An analysis examining how generative AI functions as a modern efficiency tool, its role in cognitive offloading, and the emergence of the performance confidence gap in independent writing.
                    </p>
                    <div class="hero-meta">
                        <span>Format: <strong>Analytical Overview</strong></span>
                        <span>Theme: <strong>Cognitive Offloading & Writing Autonomy</strong></span>
                        <span>Audience: <strong>Writers, Educators & Creators</strong></span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="hero-card">
                    <p class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--accent);">Core Premise</p>
                    <h2>Cognitive Offloading</h2>
                    <p>
                        While Generative AI provides an essential safety net for managing intensive writing workloads, extended reliance leads to cognitive offloading, creating an observable performance gap between assisted output and independent ability.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section: Conceptual Framework -->
        <section class="section" id="framework">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="eyebrow">Process Model</p>
                    <h2>Conceptual Framework</h2>
                    <p>Mapping the cause-and-effect chain from environmental pressure to writing proficiency.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="framework-grid">
                    <article class="framework-card">
                        <span class="stage-pill stage-input">Input: Demands</span>
                        <h3>Triggers & Pressures</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Accelerated project schedules</li>
                            <li>High volume of complex technical documentation</li>
                            <li>Writer's block and deadline constraints</li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>

                    <article class="framework-card">
                        <span class="stage-pill stage-process">Process: Workflow</span>
                        <h3>Cognitive Offloading</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>AI-assisted brainstorming and ideation</li>
                            <li>Rapid outline and structural generation</li>
                            <li>Syntax polishing and automated phrasing</li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>

                    <article class="framework-card">
                        <span class="stage-pill stage-output">Output: Impact</span>
                        <h3>Skill & Independence</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Polished, high-speed final drafts</li>
                            <li>Consistent grammar and clear organization</li>
                            <li>Emergent hesitation during unassisted work</li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section: Key Questions -->
        <section class="section" id="questions" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--line);">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="eyebrow">Key Questions</p>
                    <h2>Core Inquiries</h2>
                    <p>Three primary angles examining confidence, ideation, and long-term autonomy.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid-3">
                    <article class="rq-card">
                        <span class="card-number">01</span>
                        <h3>Confidence Shift</h3>
                        <p>Why do writers experience shifts in personal confidence when drafting with AI versus writing independently?</p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="rq-card">
                        <span class="card-number">02</span>
                        <h3>Ideation Quality</h3>
                        <p>How does AI-assisted ideation compare to organic, manual brainstorming in originality and nuance?</p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="rq-card">
                        <span class="card-number">03</span>
                        <h3>Long-Term Autonomy</h3>
                        <p>What is the lasting effect of continuous AI usage on foundational writing and critical thinking skills?</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section: Key Findings -->
        <section class="section findings" id="findings">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="eyebrow">Metrics & Insights</p>
                    <h2>Key Findings & Usage Data</h2>
                    <p>Aggregated patterns observed across multidisciplinary writing groups and technical environments.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid-3">
                    <!-- Column 1 -->
                    <article class="data-card">
                        <h3>Frequency of Use</h3>
                        <ul class="metric-list">
                            <li class="metric-item">
                                <span>Fact-checking & references</span>
                                <span class="score-badge">4.67 (Always)</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="metric-item">
                                <span>Grammar & syntax editing</span>
                                <span class="score-badge">3.47 (Often)</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="metric-item">
                                <span>Deadline brainstorming</span>
                                <span class="score-badge">3.13 (Moderate)</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="metric-item">
                                <span>Initial outline drafting</span>
                                <span class="score-badge">3.07 (Moderate)</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="metric-item">
                                <span>Raw generated text usage</span>
                                <span class="score-badge">2.20 (Rare)</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Column 2 -->
                    <article class="data-card">
                        <h3>Perceived Utility</h3>
                        <ul class="metric-list">
                            <li class="metric-item">
                                <span>Concept clarification</span>
                                <span class="score-badge">4.67 (High)</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="metric-item">
                                <span>Independent composition</span>
                                <span class="score-badge">4.02 (Agree)</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="metric-item">
                                <span>AI ideas vs. manual</span>
                                <span class="score-badge">3.67 (Comparable)</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="metric-item">
                                <span>Workload stress reduction</span>
                                <span class="score-badge">3.08 (Neutral)</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="metric-item">
                                <span>Initial factual accuracy</span>
                                <span class="score-badge">3.00 (Variable)</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Column 3 -->
                    <article class="data-card">
                        <h3>Behavioral Trends</h3>
                        <div class="finding-subgroup">
                            <h4>The Safety Net</h4>
                            <p>Writers frequently employ tools as a buffer against strict requirements, creating hesitation when drafting without assistance.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="finding-subgroup">
                            <h4>The Confidence Gap</h4>
                            <p>Even when final deliverables succeed, writers often report lower self-assurance in replicating quality from scratch.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="finding-subgroup">
                            <h4>Practical Utility</h4>
                            <p>Adoption is primarily driven by managing high-volume output rather than avoiding effort.</p>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section: Themes -->
        <section class="section" id="themes">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="eyebrow">Observations</p>
                    <h2>Key Perspectives & Themes</h2>
                    <p>Qualitative insights into how writers balance automated efficiency with authenticity.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid-3">
                    <article class="data-card">
                        <h3>Workflow Endurance</h3>
                        <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem;">
                            Tools are most often turned to as a relief valve when managing demanding deadlines, multi-project workflows, and mental fatigue during long-form tasks.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="data-card">
                        <h3>Voice & Ownership</h3>
                        <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem;">
                            Writers maintain stronger ownership when initial thoughts and direction originate organically, avoiding over-editing that risks homogenizing tone.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="data-card">
                        <h3>Establishing Boundaries</h3>
                        <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem;">
                            A clear distinction is drawn between utilizing AI for structural organization versus offloading critical analysis and core arguments.
                        </p>
                    </article>
