                            <li>Writing patterns differ significantly across technical and creative fields</li>
                            <li>Differences between specific model capabilities and prompts remain fluid</li>
                            <li>Cross-sectional snapshots capture initial adaptation rather than lifelong habit</li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>

                    <article class="editorial-card">
                        <p class="eyebrow">Looking Forward</p>
                        <h3>Future Directions</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Longitudinal tracking of unassisted writing skill retention</li>
                            <li>Comparative testing across varying levels of professional experience</li>
                            <li>Evaluating rubric standards designed specifically for augmented workflows</li>
                            <li>Investigating cognitive load differences across drafting phases</li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
