                    <p class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--accent);">Summary</p>
                    <h2>Preserving the Human Element</h2>
                    <p>
                        Generative tools offer unprecedented productivity for modern writing demands. The long-term goal is keeping AI as a collaborative sounding board while retaining ownership of critical thought and original voice.
                    </p>
                    <a class="button" href="#overview">Back to Top</a>
